MAYBE PvE Shooter

Style: 
    Design: Anime/Cartoon
    Theme: Futuristic Fantasy

Weapons: 
    Main: Ammo/Mana Based Guns
    Upgradability: With Crystals, Chips and similar things
        Uprades: Should be visible like adding Crystals as Mounts into a Gun.
    Ammo: Different Types of Ammo wich can also be modded in specific ways.

Characters: Like in LoL/Dota with Legends/Heros with special abilities and Power which can be upgraded during the game.
    Types: Mechanical and Mana
    Mana: Recharable Ammonition
    Mechanical: Magazines to reload Ammonition
    
Maps:
    War like, Tasks to be done at Hardpoints to push the oponnent back.
    

Mobs:
    AI wich follow the Players, more on the defending side as offensive, allthought there can be specific vartions of the Mobs during the game.
    To be picked up at spawn.
    Maybe buyable or progression
    Money given through the Mobs.
    
Skills:
    Minimal Skilltree pro Skill
    4 fixed Skills pro Char
    Skillpoints though EXP.
    
    
UI/UX:
    Visualisation of Progression on the Map
    Visualisation of Health/Mana or Ammo
    Visualisation of Mobs folowing

EXP:
    Killing Mobs
    Killing Players
    Capturing Hardpoint

Legend/Heros:

1. Minionmancer: Char who controlls the Mobs and can change them with his ult.
2. Stealth/Ninja/Assasin: Can get behind opponents barricades to infiltrate or plant traps.
3. Trapier: Can plant complicated Traps, ...
4. Soldier: DD Char with no big deffense ability
5. Tank: Lot of HP, rather defensive skills and weapons.
6. Healer: Defensive Weapons, can Heal Teammates with Mana or Med-Packs
7. "Hacker": Can hack into all kinds of gadgets of opponents and can get them to malfunction.

Rounds:
    Duration: Max 60Min
    Win Conditions: Deactivate the Opponents "Mana Uplink"
    After 60Min "Mana Uplink" runs out of Mana resources, Team wich is futher into the Opponents HQ wins
    Tie: Sudden Death till one Team is last on Map
    If last to Fighters kill each other SuddenDeath will reset in the Mid Map and the fight will start agan
    
    
Mana Uplink:
    Gives "normal Humans" the abbility to use Mana and Magic.
    If destroied those Humand can no longer use Mana and therefore loose the round.
